{"term":"thigh","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:118ccdfaf8003126bc","definition":"The upper leg of a human, between the hip and the knee.","example":"I coniure thee by Rosalines bright eyes, By her High forehead, and her Scarlet lip, By her Fine foote, Straight leg, and Quiuering thigh, And the Demeanes, that there Adiacent lie, That in thy likenesse thou appeare to vs.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["forethigh","midthigh","my thigh","smite hip and thigh","thighbone","thigh boot","thigh crush","thigh crushing","thighdeology","thighed","thigh gap","thigh-high","thighing","thighless","thigh master","thigh pad","thigh-shower","thigh slapper","thigh-slapper","thigh-slapping","thighward","thunder-thighed","thunder thighs","underthigh"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/thigh#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:d4eb0dd0a85ebeb9f7","definition":"That part of the leg of vertebrates (or sometimes other animals) which corresponds to the human thigh in position or function; the tibia of a horse, the tarsus of a bird; the third leg-section of an insect.","example":"Add the chicken thighs, close the bag, and squish the marinade to coat the chicken.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["forethigh","midthigh","my thigh","smite hip and thigh","thighbone","thigh boot","thigh crush","thigh crushing","thighdeology","thighed","thigh gap","thigh-high","thighing","thighless","thigh master","thigh pad","thigh-shower","thigh slapper","thigh-slapper","thigh-slapping","thighward","thunder-thighed","thunder thighs","underthigh"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/thigh#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"ipa":"/θaɪ/","us":"https://upload.wik